sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant R as Query2Resource
    participant Thin as ThinQueryService
    participant OSSIE as OssieQueryService
    participant Backend as Backend OSSIE
    Client->>R: POST /query/execute tipo OSSIE
    R->>Thin: ejecutar
    Thin->>Thin: detectar backend OSSIE
    Thin->>OSSIE: delegar sin rama MDX/olap4j
    OSSIE->>Backend: ejecutar consulta
    Backend-->>OSSIE: resultado
    OSSIE-->>Thin: CellDataSet
    Thin-->>R: QueryResult
    R-->>Client: JSON
